{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他离开后才发现孤单，想到以后遇到难事可能仍要独自承担，开始怀疑自己能不能撑下去。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"孤独、不安、犹疑、失落\",\n      \"missed\": \"他想找回过去的亲近，却不愿回去继续受气，甚至连当初离开时的决心也找不到了。这层矛盾需要读完底部的大句子才能抓全。舞步和熟悉日常如何触发失落，也需要读小字。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他离开后发现自己并没有想象中轻松，反而越来越孤单；既担心以后只能独自面对困难，又放不下过去的亲近。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"惊惶、孤独、矛盾、无助\",\n      \"missed\": \"高音带来的寒风般的身体感受、后颈发凉和脉搏加快，以及甜梦破碎、身体先被惊醒的画面；心里想冲出去却找不到出口。这些内容字号较小，而且新增文字让上半屏的信息层次更多。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他离开后才意识到孤独的代价，想重新获得过去的亲近，却又不愿回到曾经受气的处境。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"孤独、想念、挣扎、无出口\",\n      \"missed\": \"音乐从高音惊醒到舞步闯入的具体变化，以及熟悉的动作如何让他意识到失去了什么。底部关于波兰舞曲不再建立完整秩序的说明也不容易一眼读懂。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"上半屏同时放了三条较长、字号都比较醒目的叙述，虽然顶部问题最突出，但中间的离开与孤独、底部的想念与不甘心又各自占据很大视觉空间，第一眼容易只抓住独自承担的焦虑，抓不全人物内心的两难。音乐画面与人物感受实际上有联系，但高音、舞步、熟悉动作、波兰舞曲等解释分散在较小的文字里，音符动画本身又比较抽象，需要逐句阅读才能把音乐变化和人物处境串起来。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "26904256-264a-491b-9748-8f61de1afabc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T001429345178Z", "elapsed_seconds": 121.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:16:31.224648+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f430515f92420376a6b9c1bd92a365ff0b0e63323faa4b70cd8d737717f5f250", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T001429345178Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "d76ce97420b4b307759f03bc01722eefa0d8d6e34309ea65597727a280f9bd8f"}}}
